<title>CANADA: BC Tel names Calder new CEO.</title>
<headline>BC Tel names Calder new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BC Telecom Inc said Thursday that Don Calder, executive vice president of network services, was named president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Brian Canfield, who previously announced his retirement as chief executive. He will continue as chairman.</p>
<p>Calder joined BC Tel in 1971 and was named executive vice president of network services in 1995. A search committee was chaired by independent director Robert Wyman.</p>
<p>((Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314))</p>
</text>
